      "message": "**Issue #1 (Medium Severity — SHOULD FIX)**: `Create KVM Session` keyword does not close the browser it opens\n\n**Issue**: The `[Documentation]` explicitly states \"Close the secondary browser session after validation\", yet the keyword body contains no `Close Browser` call. In `Verify KVM Multiple Sessions` this keyword is called four times, leaving four extra browser instances open throughout the test. The teardown `Close All Browsers` recovers, but the accumulation of open browsers may cause resource pressure.\n\n**Fix**:\n```robot\n    Wait Until Element Is Visible  ${status}  timeout\u003d${element_wait_timeout}\n    Page Should Not Contain  Error\n    Close Browser\n```\n\n**Why**: The docstring documents the intended behaviour; the implementation must match it.",
